<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  gantry.urdf  -  GENERATED by tools/generate_gantry_urdf.py (edit the generator, not this file)

  Rail-riding machine: two sliding drive boxes, four agents, each with a traverse head.

  One chassis rides on top of the rail network. Two outrigger rails stand
  above it and reach out over the aisle on both sides of the beam. A single
  DRIVE BOX rides on those rails on each side of the beam and houses the winch
  drives + electronics for BOTH agents on that side (one shared enclosure is
  cheaper than two): a two-tone body (teal camera bay, purple service bay), a
  common lid carrying one gear-motor + encoder per bay, vents and a status LED
  per bay on the outward face, and a green power LED on a shared panel.

       FRONT side (+Y)   camera agent   (x - 0.11, OUTER bay)   service agent (x + 0.11, INNER bay)
       BACK  side (-Y)   the same, mirrored

  The two bays sit at different depths: the camera's rod hangs 0.06m further
  out than the box centre, the service agent's 0.06m further in. That
  staggering is what lets the two heads sweep along the pod past each other's
  rods without touching.

  The drive boxes SLIDE along the outriggers (prismatic joints box_front /
  box_back, value = inward travel from the operating position):
    engaged     value 0      box centre 0.445m either side of the beam - operating
    disengaged  value 0.185  boxes slid in toward each other, 0.26m either side -
                             the compact configuration used while the machine
                             changes horizontal pole and while parked on a dock

  Every agent is a hoist (prismatic joint, positive = down) mounted on its
  box's underside. The long rod is drawn at runtime (gantry_robot.py); its top
  end comes out of the box's bottom face, its bottom end into a YOKE.

  TRAVERSE HEAD: each rod ends in a yoke carrying a TELESCOPING traverse: a short
  sleeve sitting BEHIND the rod (on the side away from the pod's middle) and two
  nested bars (stage1_*, stage2_*, 0.115m each) that slide out of it along X, with
  a carriage at the tip. The tool hangs from the carriage, so the head can move
  ALONG the pod, from plant to plant, without moving the rod. Retracted, the whole
  thing is compact and stays on the far side of its own rod, so it never crosses
  the outer vertical rail's line while the hoist descends past it; it only
  extends once the head is down at the pod:
    camera agent   dark cylinder with a blue lens, facing the trough
    service agent  purple tank + nozzle tube + a slim CONTACT APPLICATOR that
                   extends (its own prismatic joint, applicator_*) until the
                   gold pad touches a plant, holds, then retracts

  Kinematic chain:
    base_link -> carriage_joint (X) -> carriage_link          (no visual)
              -> row_joint      (Y) -> row_link               (chassis, portal, outriggers)
                 -> box_front (Y, slides) -> front_box_link   (merged drive box)
                       -> hoist_front_camera  (-Z) -> front_camera_link  (yoke + sleeve)
                             -> stage1_front_camera (X) -> stage2_front_camera (X) -> front_camera_stage_link (carriage + camera)
                       -> hoist_front_service (-Z) -> front_service_link (yoke + sleeve)
                             -> stage1_front_service (X) -> stage2_front_service (X) -> front_service_stage_link (carriage + tank)
                                   -> applicator_front_service -> front_service_applicator_link
                 -> box_back ... (mirror)

  Drive rules (enforced in gantry_robot.py, not here): the chassis only moves
  along ONE axis at a time and only along a rail; it changes horizontal pole
  (moves in Y) only with the boxes slid in; a box only slides with every hoist
  stowed, every head centred and the machine standing still; hoists only
  deploy with the boxes out.

  Vertical reference, relative to the chassis-plate centre (which sits 0.09m
  above the rail's centreline; beam half-thickness is 0.03):
       +0.289  top of the drive-box motors / encoder caps
       +0.247  top of the drive-box lid
       +0.239  top of the outrigger rails = top of the drive-box body
       +0.215  underside of the outrigger rails
       +0.155  hoist joint origin = bottom of each drive box (rods come out here)
       +0.107  telescoping traverse centre (hoist origin - 0.048)
       +0.06  tool-head centre (hoist origin - 0.095) when the hoist is stowed
       +0.015  top of the chassis plate
        0.000  chassis plate centre  (base_link is placed here)
       -0.060  wheel bottoms = the rail's top face
  Change any of these together with the matching constants in
  gantry_robot.py - verify_motion.py will tell you if something now collides.
-->
<robot name="pod_farm_gantry">

  <material name="chassis_orange"><color rgba="0.9 0.55 0.1 1"/></material>
  <material name="wheel_dark"><color rgba="0.1 0.1 0.12 1"/></material>
  <material name="portal_grey"><color rgba="0.6 0.6 0.64 1"/></material>
  <material name="crossrail_dark"><color rgba="0.25 0.25 0.28 1"/></material>
  <material name="box_teal"><color rgba="0.1 0.45 0.55 1"/></material>
  <material name="box_purple"><color rgba="0.38 0.17 0.52 1"/></material>
  <material name="box_seam"><color rgba="0.1 0.1 0.12 1"/></material>
  <material name="lid_grey"><color rgba="0.72 0.73 0.76 1"/></material>
  <material name="panel_grey"><color rgba="0.55 0.57 0.6 1"/></material>
  <material name="motor_dark"><color rgba="0.2 0.21 0.24 1"/></material>
  <material name="cap_light"><color rgba="0.85 0.86 0.88 1"/></material>
  <material name="vent_dark"><color rgba="0.05 0.05 0.06 1"/></material>
  <material name="led_blue"><color rgba="0.25 0.65 1 1"/></material>
  <material name="led_amber"><color rgba="1 0.7 0.1 1"/></material>
  <material name="led_green"><color rgba="0.2 0.95 0.35 1"/></material>
  <material name="hoist_blue"><color rgba="0.15 0.45 0.75 1"/></material>
  <material name="guide_steel"><color rgba="0.62 0.64 0.68 1"/></material>
  <material name="sleeve_dark"><color rgba="0.3 0.32 0.36 1"/></material>
  <material name="bar_light"><color rgba="0.8 0.82 0.86 1"/></material>
  <material name="carriage_orange"><color rgba="0.92 0.45 0.1 1"/></material>
  <material name="camera_dark"><color rgba="0.06 0.06 0.06 1"/></material>
  <material name="lens_glass"><color rgba="0.2 0.55 0.95 1"/></material>
  <material name="lens_glass_b"><color rgba="0.2 0.85 0.7 1"/></material>
  <material name="module_a"><color rgba="0.15 0.55 1 1"/></material>
  <material name="module_b"><color rgba="0.1 0.95 0.65 1"/></material>
  <material name="lens_dark"><color rgba="0.02 0.03 0.08 1"/></material>
  <material name="tank_purple"><color rgba="0.55 0.2 0.75 1"/></material>
  <material name="tank_band"><color rgba="0.95 0.95 0.97 1"/></material>
  <material name="nozzle_grey"><color rgba="0.35 0.35 0.38 1"/></material>
  <material name="pad_gold"><color rgba="0.95 0.75 0.15 1"/></material>
  <material name="rod_steel"><color rgba="0.78 0.79 0.82 1"/></material>

  <!-- fixed anchor: deliberately NO visual, the machine travels the whole rail network -->
  <link name="base_link">
    <inertial><mass value="0"/><inertia ixx="0" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0" iyz="0" izz="0"/></inertial>
  </link>

  <!-- X axis: travel along a horizontal rail ("horizontal pole") -->
  <link name="carriage_link">
    <inertial><mass value="1"/><inertia ixx="0.01" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.01" iyz="0" izz="0.01"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="carriage_joint" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="base_link"/><child link="carriage_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="-0.5" upper="2.5" effort="250" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- Y axis: travel along an outer vertical rail (row to row, and out to the dock bars).
       The visible machine body is attached to this link. -->
  <link name="row_link">
    <!-- chassis plate -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.26 0.2 0.03"/></geometry><material name="chassis_orange"/></visual>
    <!-- wheels for travel along X (axle along Y) -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0.05 0 -0.038" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.022" length="0.024"/></geometry><material name="wheel_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.05 0 -0.038" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.022" length="0.024"/></geometry><material name="wheel_dark"/></visual>
    <!-- wheels for travel along Y (axle along X), used on the outer rails -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.05 -0.038" rpy="0 1.5708 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.022" length="0.024"/></geometry><material name="wheel_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.05 -0.038" rpy="0 1.5708 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.022" length="0.024"/></geometry><material name="wheel_dark"/></visual>
    <!-- portal posts -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0 0.115" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.024 0.06 0.2"/></geometry><material name="portal_grey"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0 0.115" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.024 0.06 0.2"/></geometry><material name="portal_grey"/></visual>
    <!-- outrigger rails: run along Y; the drive boxes slide on them -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0 0.227" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.04 1.1 0.024"/></geometry><material name="crossrail_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0 0.227" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.04 1.1 0.024"/></geometry><material name="crossrail_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="2"/><inertia ixx="0.02" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.02" iyz="0" izz="0.02"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="row_joint" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="carriage_link"/><child link="row_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 1 0"/>
    <limit lower="-1.5" upper="4" effort="250" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- MERGED DRIVE BOX, FRONT side: winch drives + electronics for the camera agent (x-0.11, outer bay)
       and the service agent (x+0.11, inner bay) in one enclosure. Slides along the outriggers. -->
  <link name="front_box_link">
    <!-- two-tone body: teal camera bay (-x half), purple service bay (+x half), dark seam between -->
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.07625 0 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.1525 0.205 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_teal"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.07625 0 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.1525 0.205 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_purple"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.102551 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.004 0.0022 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_seam"/></visual>
    <!-- common lid -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0.243" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.315 0.215 0.008"/></geometry><material name="lid_grey"/></visual>
    <!-- one gear-motor + encoder cap per bay, over each rod -->
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.06 0.262" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="motor_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.06 0.283" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.012" length="0.012"/></geometry><material name="cap_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.06 0.262" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="motor_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.06 0.283" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.012" length="0.012"/></geometry><material name="cap_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.1035 0.17" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.1035 0.181" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.1035 0.192" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.1035 0.17" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.1035 0.181" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.1035 0.192" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 0.1045 0.217" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.007"/></geometry><material name="led_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.1045 0.217" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.007"/></geometry><material name="led_amber"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.1037 0.19" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.06 0.0024 0.05"/></geometry><material name="panel_grey"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.1059 0.205" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.0055"/></geometry><material name="led_green"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="1"/><inertia ixx="0.005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.005" iyz="0" izz="0.005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="box_front" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="row_link"/><child link="front_box_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0.445 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 -1 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.3" effort="200" velocity="0.35"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- FRONT CAMERA agent: hoist (hangs from the front drive box) -> yoke + sleeve of the telescoping traverse -->
  <link name="front_camera_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.015" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.036" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.04 0.012"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.03 0.026"/></geometry><material name="sleeve_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.4"/><inertia ixx="0.002" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.002" iyz="0" izz="0.002"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="hoist_front_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_box_link"/><child link="front_camera_link"/>
    <origin xyz="-0.11 0.06 0.155" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 0 -1"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="2.6" effort="200" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- telescoping traverse, first stage: a bar sliding out of the sleeve -->
  <link name="front_camera_bar1_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.022 0.02"/></geometry><material name="guide_steel"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.15"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage1_front_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_camera_link"/><child link="front_camera_bar1_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.115" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- second stage: a thinner bar sliding out of the first, with the carriage and the tool at its tip -->
  <link name="front_camera_stage_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.016 0.014"/></geometry><material name="bar_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.07 0.045 0.03"/></geometry><material name="carriage_orange"/></visual>
    <!-- CAMERA head: dark cylinder + bracket bar carrying a stereo pair of camera modules (A blue = left, B green-teal = right) -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.03" length="0.07"/></geometry><material name="camera_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.0405 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.084 0.012 0.016"/></geometry><material name="camera_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.02 -0.0555 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.03 0.018 0.03"/></geometry><material name="module_a"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.02 -0.0555 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.03 0.018 0.03"/></geometry><material name="module_b"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.02 -0.0665 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.01" length="0.004"/></geometry><material name="lens_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.02 -0.0665 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.01" length="0.004"/></geometry><material name="lens_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.3"/><inertia ixx="0.001" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.001" iyz="0" izz="0.001"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage2_front_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_camera_bar1_link"/><child link="front_camera_stage_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.115" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- FRONT SERVICE agent: hoist (hangs from the front drive box) -> yoke + sleeve of the telescoping traverse -->
  <link name="front_service_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.015" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.036" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.04 0.012"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.03 0.026"/></geometry><material name="sleeve_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.4"/><inertia ixx="0.002" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.002" iyz="0" izz="0.002"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="hoist_front_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_box_link"/><child link="front_service_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0.11 -0.06 0.155" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 0 -1"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="2.6" effort="200" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- telescoping traverse, first stage: a bar sliding out of the sleeve -->
  <link name="front_service_bar1_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.022 0.02"/></geometry><material name="guide_steel"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.15"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage1_front_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_service_link"/><child link="front_service_bar1_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="-0.115" upper="0" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- second stage: a thinner bar sliding out of the first, with the carriage and the tool at its tip -->
  <link name="front_service_stage_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.016 0.014"/></geometry><material name="bar_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.07 0.045 0.03"/></geometry><material name="carriage_orange"/></visual>
    <!-- SERVICE head: upright purple tank with a white band, and a nozzle tube facing the trough.
         The contact applicator (next link) slides out of the tube's end. -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.032" length="0.06"/></geometry><material name="tank_purple"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.0335" length="0.008"/></geometry><material name="tank_band"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.0495 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.008" length="0.035"/></geometry><material name="nozzle_grey"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.3"/><inertia ixx="0.001" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.001" iyz="0" izz="0.001"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage2_front_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_service_bar1_link"/><child link="front_service_stage_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="-0.115" upper="0" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- contact applicator: a slim rod that slides out of the nozzle tube until its gold pad touches
       a plant. Link origin = the tube's end (0.067 from the tank centre, toward the pod). -->
  <link name="front_service_applicator_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.044 0" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.006" length="0.098"/></geometry><material name="rod_steel"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.009 0" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.008"/></geometry><material name="pad_gold"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.1"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="applicator_front_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="front_service_stage_link"/><child link="front_service_applicator_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 -0.067 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 -1 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.1" effort="40" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="2" friction="0.2"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- MERGED DRIVE BOX, BACK side: winch drives + electronics for the camera agent (x-0.11, outer bay)
       and the service agent (x+0.11, inner bay) in one enclosure. Slides along the outriggers. -->
  <link name="back_box_link">
    <!-- two-tone body: teal camera bay (-x half), purple service bay (+x half), dark seam between -->
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.07625 0 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.1525 0.205 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_teal"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.07625 0 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.1525 0.205 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_purple"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.102551 0.197" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.004 0.0022 0.084"/></geometry><material name="box_seam"/></visual>
    <!-- common lid -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0.243" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.315 0.215 0.008"/></geometry><material name="lid_grey"/></visual>
    <!-- one gear-motor + encoder cap per bay, over each rod -->
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.06 0.262" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="motor_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.06 0.283" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.012" length="0.012"/></geometry><material name="cap_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.06 0.262" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="motor_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 0.06 0.283" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.012" length="0.012"/></geometry><material name="cap_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.1035 0.17" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.1035 0.181" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.1035 0.192" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.1035 0.17" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.1035 0.181" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.1035 0.192" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.003 0.006"/></geometry><material name="vent_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.11 -0.1045 0.217" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.007"/></geometry><material name="led_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.11 -0.1045 0.217" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.007"/></geometry><material name="led_amber"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.1037 0.19" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.06 0.0024 0.05"/></geometry><material name="panel_grey"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.1059 0.205" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><sphere radius="0.0055"/></geometry><material name="led_green"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="1"/><inertia ixx="0.005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.005" iyz="0" izz="0.005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="box_back" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="row_link"/><child link="back_box_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 -0.445 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 1 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.3" effort="200" velocity="0.35"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- BACK CAMERA agent: hoist (hangs from the back drive box) -> yoke + sleeve of the telescoping traverse -->
  <link name="back_camera_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.015" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.036" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.04 0.012"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.03 0.026"/></geometry><material name="sleeve_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.4"/><inertia ixx="0.002" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.002" iyz="0" izz="0.002"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="hoist_back_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_box_link"/><child link="back_camera_link"/>
    <origin xyz="-0.11 -0.06 0.155" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 0 -1"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="2.6" effort="200" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- telescoping traverse, first stage: a bar sliding out of the sleeve -->
  <link name="back_camera_bar1_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.022 0.02"/></geometry><material name="guide_steel"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.15"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage1_back_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_camera_link"/><child link="back_camera_bar1_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.115" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- second stage: a thinner bar sliding out of the first, with the carriage and the tool at its tip -->
  <link name="back_camera_stage_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.016 0.014"/></geometry><material name="bar_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.07 0.045 0.03"/></geometry><material name="carriage_orange"/></visual>
    <!-- CAMERA head: dark cylinder + bracket bar carrying a stereo pair of camera modules (A blue = left, B green-teal = right) -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.03" length="0.07"/></geometry><material name="camera_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.0405 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.084 0.012 0.016"/></geometry><material name="camera_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.02 0.0555 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.03 0.018 0.03"/></geometry><material name="module_a"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.02 0.0555 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.03 0.018 0.03"/></geometry><material name="module_b"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="-0.02 0.0665 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.01" length="0.004"/></geometry><material name="lens_dark"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.02 0.0665 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.01" length="0.004"/></geometry><material name="lens_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.3"/><inertia ixx="0.001" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.001" iyz="0" izz="0.001"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage2_back_camera" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_camera_bar1_link"/><child link="back_camera_stage_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.115" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- BACK SERVICE agent: hoist (hangs from the back drive box) -> yoke + sleeve of the telescoping traverse -->
  <link name="back_service_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.015" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.03"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.036" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.05 0.04 0.012"/></geometry><material name="hoist_blue"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.03 0.026"/></geometry><material name="sleeve_dark"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.4"/><inertia ixx="0.002" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.002" iyz="0" izz="0.002"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="hoist_back_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_box_link"/><child link="back_service_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0.11 0.06 0.155" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 0 -1"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="2.6" effort="200" velocity="0.6"/>
    <dynamics damping="5" friction="1"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- telescoping traverse, first stage: a bar sliding out of the sleeve -->
  <link name="back_service_bar1_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.022 0.02"/></geometry><material name="guide_steel"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.15"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage1_back_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_service_link"/><child link="back_service_bar1_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 -0.048" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="-0.115" upper="0" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- second stage: a thinner bar sliding out of the first, with the carriage and the tool at its tip -->
  <link name="back_service_stage_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0.03 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.13 0.016 0.014"/></geometry><material name="bar_light"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><box size="0.07 0.045 0.03"/></geometry><material name="carriage_orange"/></visual>
    <!-- SERVICE head: upright purple tank with a white band, and a nozzle tube facing the trough.
         The contact applicator (next link) slides out of the tube's end. -->
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.032" length="0.06"/></geometry><material name="tank_purple"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.0335" length="0.008"/></geometry><material name="tank_band"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.0495 -0.047" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.008" length="0.035"/></geometry><material name="nozzle_grey"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.3"/><inertia ixx="0.001" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.001" iyz="0" izz="0.001"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="stage2_back_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_service_bar1_link"/><child link="back_service_stage_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="1 0 0"/>
    <limit lower="-0.115" upper="0" effort="60" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="3" friction="0.5"/>
  </joint>

  <!-- contact applicator: a slim rod that slides out of the nozzle tube until its gold pad touches
       a plant. Link origin = the tube's end (0.067 from the tank centre, toward the pod). -->
  <link name="back_service_applicator_link">
    <visual><origin xyz="0 -0.044 0" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.006" length="0.098"/></geometry><material name="rod_steel"/></visual>
    <visual><origin xyz="0 0.009 0" rpy="1.5708 0 0"/><geometry><cylinder radius="0.02" length="0.008"/></geometry><material name="pad_gold"/></visual>
    <inertial><mass value="0.1"/><inertia ixx="0.0005" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0.0005" iyz="0" izz="0.0005"/></inertial>
  </link>
  <joint name="applicator_back_service" type="prismatic">
    <parent link="back_service_stage_link"/><child link="back_service_applicator_link"/>
    <origin xyz="0 0.067 -0.047" rpy="0 0 0"/><axis xyz="0 1 0"/>
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.1" effort="40" velocity="0.25"/>
    <dynamics damping="2" friction="0.2"/>
  </joint>

</robot>
